From d293d581329a614269f99249ea52d9446c3170c4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Brad Larmie <brad@abridge.com>
Date: Sun, 15 Mar 2026 17:34:08 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] Ambient Assessment: UX and copy elevation

- Screen2Baseline: remove time saved question (captured in capacity domain)
- Screen4Domains: rewrite all domain headlines/subheadlines/reframes; fix level labels and descriptions; fix CTA copy; remove duplicate instruction text
- Screen3Score: domain-aware verdict, floor framing, unified score labels
- Screen5Gap: measured vs unmeasured layout, benchmark ranges, formula transparency
- Screen6Invitation: benchmark contrast cards replacing roadmap, rewritten invitation copy
- domainCalculations.ts: aspirational footnote warning
- ambient-assessment-pdf.tsx: unified score labels, NOT YET MEASURED treatment, formula differentiation
---
